# Premium Design Kit

Read `skills/premium-design-kit/SKILL.md` (and `references/design-system.md`) before designing.

Quick reference:
- Setup: `bash skills/premium-design-kit/scripts/setup.sh` (venv), `fonts.sh` (free Arabic/Latin fonts — ask first), `selftest.sh`.
- `bash skills/premium-design-kit/scripts/run.sh skills/premium-design-kit/scripts/kit.py themes --html gallery.html | tokens <id> | chart spec.json out.png | art <kind> out.jpg | asset '<ref>' dir | preview <file>`.
- Asset refs everywhere: path · {"photo": q} · {"stock": id} · {"icon": q} · {"art": kind} · {"chart": {…}}.
